  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nNumber = 7396\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b²\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ 7396 = (80 + 6)²\n\n⇒ (80 + 6)² = 80² + 2 × 80 × 6 + 6²\n\n⇒ = 6400 + 960 + 36\n\n⇒ = 7396\n\n⇒ Square root = 80 + 6 = 86\n\n**∴ √7396 = 86**",
